! Ahead: a word that comes before the hole, and the hole takes a gerund.
!
! An alternative to folding, and the point is that it never surprises. A folded
! `-G` is free but only where the folded stroke has no entry of its own: `RUPBG`
! is "rung", so "run" plus a folded `-G` never happens and the writer has to know
! which words those are. Stroking the suffix afterwards is a stroke either way.
! So the inflection rides on a word that was going to be stroked anyway, and the
! stroke that writes "by" also says what the next word will be.
!
!   ^PW*EU  RUPB   ->   "by running"
!   ^STO*P  TKPW   ->   "stop going"
!
! `[AFTER]` is what waits: the tail of the record is written after the unit that
! follows it. The tail is `{:infl:ing}` and not `{^ing}`, because a lexicon knows
! that the gerund of "lie" is "lying" and a rule does not. Nothing here reads the
! word: there is no window and no letter on the tape.
!
! ---- keys
!
! The word's own brief and `*` for the hole. No key names the suffix, because
! every word here takes the same one: a preposition or one of these verbs governs
! a gerund and nothing else.
!
! `^` is the family stem, as in `retro-words` and `repeat-word`. Not `S-`, which
! `frames` uses: these briefs are short, and `S` plus `HE` is `SHE`.
!
! A subject before the hole is not here. "he is _ing" is a clause, so it belongs
! in phrasing, where a hole can be an ender and the whole aspect grammar still
! applies to it: agreement, negation, the question, do-support. A flat table here
! would be that grammar written out badly.

! ---- prepositions
^PW*EU	by[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^A*F	after[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^PW*FR	before[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^WO*UT	without[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^WHAO*EUL	while[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^WO*RT	worth[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]

! ---- verbs that govern a gerund
^KAO*EP	keep[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^STA*RT	start[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^STO*P	stop[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^TKPW*EUPB	begin[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^T*PB	continue[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^TPHO*EUPBLG	enjoy[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^TP*EURB	finish[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^PHAO*EUPBD	mind[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^R*EUFBG	risk[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^K*R	consider[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^PHA*PBLG	imagine[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^S*UG	suggest[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
^TKPW*UP	give up[AFTER][META=infl]ing[END][END]
